Order=56
Title=Wallpapers from the web
Body=Two more wallpaper sources are built in. Bing adds a fresh photograph from around the world every day, and the OCS networks (pling.com, opendesktop.org and kde-look.org) let you browse and download wallpapers. Both appear in Settings with the other wallpaper sets.
Scene=settings
Action=settings:desktop
ActionLabel=Open Settings
